David M. Russinoff
david@russinoff.com
http://www.russinoff.com

This directory contains an ACL2 formalization of elementary field theory.
The books of the top-level directory are listed below.

  * extensions:
    - Definitions of finite field extension and operations on fields and polynomial rings
    - Algebraic properties of fields and polynomials
    - Greatest common divisor
    - Divisibility of polynomials
    - Irreducible polynomials
    - Field homomorphisms
    - Embedding of a field in an extension field

  * vectors
    - Matrices over fields
    - Field extensions as vector spaces

  * polynomials
    - Polynomial evaluation
    - Factorization
    - Primitive element of an extension
    - Algebraic nature of finite field extensions: minimal polynomials

  * embeddings:
    - Embeddings and meta-embeddings of an extension field
    - Composition of embeddings
    - Isomorphisms and inverse embeddings
    - Fields and metafields

  * galois:
    - Automorphism group of an extension field
    - Artin's Lemma
    - Characteristic of a field
    - Formal derivative
    - Separable polynomials
    - Splitting fields
    - Galois extensions
    - Fundamental Theorem of Galois Theory
